; The function words. Each item (17 cards, from items: its end card, n, and its run with an edge on each side) and
; after it the whole deck of function words (text/function.cards: each its letters and -52, then -99) in; out 1 for
; a word (an item ended by -10) that is a function word, else 0. The word's letters are kept in cells 80-93, and
; matched against each word of the deck as the deck goes by: at is the next letter to match, 99 once one has failed.
; Anything that isn't a word has n -1, and nothing matches.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            item    INP   end      03-23: an item: its letters into 80-93
  04                    INP   n
  05                    INP   d
  06                    CLA   s80
  07                    STO   wr
  08            wr      DATA  0        (INP 80 + k)
  09                    CLA   wr
  10                    ADD   00
  11                    STO   wr
  12                    SUB   s94
  13                    TAC   wr
  14                    CLA   z
  15                    STO   r
  16                    CLA   end
  17                    ADD   n10
  18                    TAC   nw
  19                    SUB   00
  20                    TAC   word
  21            nw      CLA   m1
  22                    STO   n
  23            word    CLA   00       23-46: the deck, a card at a time
  24                    STO   at
  25            dk      INP   d
  26                    CLA   d
  27                    TAC   neg
  28                    CLA   n
  29                    SUB   at
  30                    TAC   no
  31                    CLA   c79
  32                    ADD   at
  33                    STO   rd
  34            rd      DATA  0        (CLA 79 + at)
  35                    SUB   d
  36                    TAC   no
  37                    SUB   00
  38                    TAC   yes
  39            no      CLA   c99
  40                    STO   at
  41                    JMP   dk
  42            yes     CLA   at
  43                    ADD   00
  44                    STO   at
  45                    JMP   dk
  46            neg     ADD   c98      46-61: a word of the deck ends: the item's, if it matched all of it; -99 the deck's end
  47                    TAC   out
  48                    CLA   n
  49                    ADD   00
  50                    SUB   at
  51                    TAC   word
  52                    SUB   00
  53                    TAC   hit
  54                    JMP   word
  55            hit     CLA   00
  56                    STO   r
  57                    JMP   word
  58            out     OUT   r
  59                    JMP   item
  70            end     DATA  0
  71            n       DATA  0
  72            r       DATA  0
  73            at      DATA  0
  74            d       DATA  0
  75            z       DATA  0
  76            m1      DATA  -1
  77            n10     DATA  10
  78            c99     DATA  99
  79            c98     DATA  98
  94            s80     INP   80
  95            s94     INP   94
  96            c79     CLA   79
